WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.555
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind different input devices.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:11.273
Keyboard: inputs typed letters and digits. Mouse: inputs clicks and movements.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:17.795
Microphone: inputs recorded sound. Scanner: inputs pictures from paper. Camera:

00:00:17.795 --> 00:00:19.498
inputs digital photographs.

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:25.417
In a small group, draw or safely examine pictures of keyboard, mouse and microphone.

00:00:25.417 --> 00:00:28.303
Explain one real-life use for each in Ghana.
